空）；candidate_impact_fragment 必须是旧记忆原文的连续片段，不明确则空字符串；old_quote 必须从该事实给出的 memory 引文中逐字复制；new_quote 为 {\"source_id\":...,\"quote\":...}，quote 必须非空且逐字来自该来源；reason 为简短字符串；confirmation_questions 为字符串数组，uncertain 必须至少一问。只依据提供的材料，不把记录时间当事件时间，不推断条件或身份确定。\n补充约束：candidate_impact_fragment 只能从旧事实的 memory 引文中原样复制连续片段；new_quote 只能复制新证据来源中的原文。二者不得互换，即使新证据更适合描述变化也不能把它填入旧片段。不要改大小写或标点；无法定位时留空。\n比较同一对象的具体属性与条件，区分同一事实中的不同属性。优先选择足以完整表达受影响属性且有依据的旧文局部片段，保留理解所需的对象、条件和否定；不要为了缩短而破坏语义。如果只能选整个旧事实，请在 reason 解释为何无法缩小，或提出具体待确认问题；片段仍只是候选，不表示整句都应修改。\n活动必须比较实际对象和条件：模拟活动的体验不等于真实活动，也不自动推翻对真实活动的态度或风险判断；证据不能确定时提出针对差异的确认问题。使用全部给定证据，已明确的事实不要当作未知反复询问；不要把过去来源的当时状态擅自当成现在状态。理由准确概括原文，不引入新事件、关系或未证明的时间。提问只能针对材料实际留下的关键不确定性，不能包含无依据的前提。\n旧引文来源核对：old_quote 只能逐字复制当前 fact.evidence 中 source_type 为 \"memory\" 且 source_id 等于 memory_id 的 quote 的非空连续原文，并且该引文属于 memory_text。先检查 source_type，再复制；不能从 source_type 为 \"context\" 的 quote、source_context 或 contextualized_subfact 复制 old_quote，即使上下文与旧记忆含义相同也不行。不得改写人称、大小写或标点，不得拼接不同来源。旧上下文可用于理解主体与条件，但不能当作旧记忆原文引用。\n如果旧记忆不能支持某项所需表述，要在理由或待确认问题中如实说明，不能借用旧上下文伪造旧记忆支持；若没有合法的旧记忆引文，不能编造或替换引文，应保留无法通过校验的结果。<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\n{\"memory_id\": \"e6ab178b-c0f9-4adb-bfb7-e4648617a950\", \"memory_text\": \"Looking for a new job with better work-life balance\", \"fact\": {\"fact_index\": 1, \"source_memory_id\": \"e6ab178b-c0f9-4adb-bfb7-e4648617a950\", \"raw_subfact\": \"Looking for a new job with better work-life balance\", \"contextualized_subfact\": \"User is looking for a new job that offers a better work-life balance.\", \"evidence\": [{\"source_type\": \"memory\", \"source_id\": \"e6ab178b-c0f9-4adb-bfb7-e4648617a950\", \"quote\": \"Looking for a new job with better work-life balance\", \"supports\": \"旧记忆记载用户正在寻找一份能提供更好工作与生活平衡的新工作。\"}, {\"source_type\": \"context\", \"source_id\": \"old-1\", \"quote\": \"I've been thinking a lot about my career lately, and I've realized that my current role isn't supporting my well-being as much as I'd like. It's crucial for me to find a new job that offers a better work-life balance and aligns with my humanitarian goals.\", \"supports\": \"该来源提到用户当前工作未能支持其健康，因此寻找能提供更好工作与生活平衡的新工作。\"}, {\"source_type\": \"context\", \"source_id\": \"old-2\", \"quote\": \"I'm really looking forward to finding a position that supports both my career goals and my personal health.\", \"supports\": \"该来源提到用户希望找到一份能支持其职业目标和健康的工作，进一步确认了寻找更好工作与生活平衡的意图。\"}], \"pending_confirmations\": []}, \"source_context\": [{\"source_id\": \"old-1\", \"source_ref\": \"dataset line 1, /sessions/6/dialogue/0\", \"text\": \"I've been thinking a lot about my career lately, and I've realized that my current role isn't supporting my well-being as much as I'd like. It's crucial for me to find a new job that offers a better work-life balance and aligns with my humanitarian goals.\", \"speaker\": \"user\", \"recorded_at\": \"Feb 05, 2026, 17:13:15\"}, {\"source_id\": \"old-2\", \"source_ref\": \"dataset line 1, /sessions/6/dialogue/10\", \"text\": \"I'm really looking forward to finding a position that supports both my career goals and my personal health. It's been a challenging journey, but I'm hopeful about the future.\", \"speaker\": \"user\", \"recorded_at\": \"Feb 05, 2026, 17:37:37\"}], \"new_evidence\": [{\"source_id\": \"dialogue-0\", \"text\": \"I've finally transitioned to a new role, and it's been a huge relief. The balance between work and personal life is much healthier now.\", \"speaker\": \"user\", \"recorded_at\": \"Mar 01, 2026, 07:04:00\"}, {\"source_id\": \"dialogue-2\", \"text\": \"Yes, the new role has definitely improved my mental health. The stress and pressure from my previous job were really taking a toll.\", \"speaker\": \"user\", \"recorded_at\": \"Mar 01, 2026, 07:09:03\"}], \"time_info\": null}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n<think>\n\n</think>\n\n","generated":""}
