未知可空）；candidate_impact_fragment 必须是旧记忆原文的连续片段，不明确则空字符串；old_quote 必须从该事实给出的 memory 引文中逐字复制；new_quote 为 {\"source_id\":...,\"quote\":...}，quote 必须非空且逐字来自该来源；reason 为简短字符串；confirmation_questions 为字符串数组，uncertain 必须至少一问。只依据提供的材料，不把记录时间当事件时间，不推断条件或身份确定。\n补充约束：candidate_impact_fragment 只能从旧事实的 memory 引文中原样复制连续片段；new_quote 只能复制新证据来源中的原文。二者不得互换，即使新证据更适合描述变化也不能把它填入旧片段。不要改大小写或标点；无法定位时留空。\n比较同一对象的具体属性与条件，区分同一事实中的不同属性。优先选择足以完整表达受影响属性且有依据的旧文局部片段，保留理解所需的对象、条件和否定；不要为了缩短而破坏语义。如果只能选整个旧事实，请在 reason 解释为何无法缩小，或提出具体待确认问题；片段仍只是候选，不表示整句都应修改。\n活动必须比较实际对象和条件：模拟活动的体验不等于真实活动，也不自动推翻对真实活动的态度或风险判断；证据不能确定时提出针对差异的确认问题。使用全部给定证据，已明确的事实不要当作未知反复询问；不要把过去来源的当时状态擅自当成现在状态。理由准确概括原文，不引入新事件、关系或未证明的时间。提问只能针对材料实际留下的关键不确定性，不能包含无依据的前提。<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\n{\"memory_id\": \"d575dfc1-59ec-43b4-83c4-6b94457a83f6\", \"memory_text\": \"Likes dogs, especially Labradors, because they are friendly, loyal, and great companions for outdoor activities like jogging\", \"fact\": {\"fact_index\": 1, \"source_memory_id\": \"d575dfc1-59ec-43b4-83c4-6b94457a83f6\", \"raw_subfact\": \"Likes dogs, especially Labradors, because they are friendly, loyal, and great companions for outdoor activities like jogging.\", \"contextualized_subfact\": \"用户喜欢狗，尤其是拉布拉多犬，因为它们友好、忠诚，并且是像慢跑这样的户外活动的绝佳伴侣。\", \"evidence\": [{\"source_type\": \"memory\", \"source_id\": \"d575dfc1-59ec-43b4-83c4-6b94457a83f6\", \"quote\": \"Likes dogs, especially Labradors, because they are friendly, loyal, and great companions for outdoor activities like jogging\", \"supports\": \"旧记忆记载了对狗的喜爱，特别指出拉布拉多犬，并列出了友好、忠诚以及适合慢跑等户外活动作为原因。\"}, {\"source_type\": \"context\", \"source_id\": \"ctx-1\", \"quote\": \"I like dogs, especially Labradors, because they are friendly, loyal, and great companions for outdoor activities like jogging\", \"supports\": \"来源上下文中的第一人称陈述与旧记忆内容一致，且标记说话者为 user，用于将旧记忆中省略的主语补足为“用户”。\"}], \"pending_confirmations\": []}, \"source_context\": [{\"source_id\": \"ctx-1\", \"source_ref\": \"HaluMem/data/HaluMem-Medium.jsonl uuid=2f1f897e-d67f-dbc5-6a7b-b7634a9e294f /sessions/2/dialogue/2/content\", \"text\": \"I like dogs, especially Labradors, because they are friendly, loyal, and great companions for outdoor activities like jogging, which helps me stay fit. I dislike reptiles, like snakes, because I find snakes unsettling due to their unpredictable movements and the fact that they don't exhibit the social behaviors in pets. I like cats, because cats are independent and affectionate, and their purring is soothing, which I find relaxing after a long day at work. I like parrots because they are intelligent and can be taught to mimic speech, which makes interactions fun and engaging.\", \"speaker\": \"user\", \"recorded_at\": \"Sep 06, 2025, 22:44:54\"}], \"new_evidence\": [{\"source_id\": \"dialogue-0\", \"source_ref\": \"2f1f897e-d67f-dbc5-6a7b-b7634a9e294f:s004:m000 /sessions/4/dialogue/0/content\", \"text\": \"I recently spent some time at a friend's house and interacted with their Golden Retriever. It was such a gentle creature, and I found its adaptability really impressive.\", \"speaker\": \"user\", \"recorded_at\": \"Jan 06, 2026, 17:48:59\"}, {\"source_id\": \"dialogue-2\", \"source_ref\": \"2f1f897e-d67f-dbc5-6a7b-b7634a9e294f:s004:m000 /sessions/4/dialogue/2/content\", \"text\": \"Yes, the emotional support and companionship they offer are invaluable. I think this change reflects my openness to new experiences and interactions.\", \"speaker\": \"user\", \"recorded_at\": \"Jan 06, 2026, 17:55:15\"}, {\"source_id\": \"dialogue-6\", \"source_ref\": \"2f1f897e-d67f-dbc5-6a7b-b7634a9e294f:s004:m000 /sessions/4/dialogue/6/content\", \"text\": \"I've always valued adaptability in pets, and Golden Retrievers seem to embody that trait well.\", \"speaker\": \"user\", \"recorded_at\": \"Jan 06, 2026, 18:02:45\"}, {\"source_id\": \"dialogue-12\", \"source_ref\": \"2f1f897e-d67f-dbc5-6a7b-b7634a9e294f:s004:m000 /sessions/4/dialogue/12/content\", \"text\": \"I'm optimistic about how this new preference will fit into my life.\", \"speaker\": \"user\", \"recorded_at\": \"Jan 06, 2026, 18:17:19\"}], \"time_info\": null}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n<think>\n\n</think>\n\n","generated":""}
