未知可空）；candidate_impact_fragment 必须是旧记忆原文的连续片段，不明确则空字符串；old_quote 必须从该事实给出的 memory 引文中逐字复制；new_quote 为 {\"source_id\":...,\"quote\":...}，quote 必须非空且逐字来自该来源；reason 为简短字符串；confirmation_questions 为字符串数组，uncertain 必须至少一问。只依据提供的材料，不把记录时间当事件时间，不推断条件或身份确定。\n补充约束：candidate_impact_fragment 只能从旧事实的 memory 引文中原样复制连续片段；new_quote 只能复制新证据来源中的原文。二者不得互换，即使新证据更适合描述变化也不能把它填入旧片段。不要改大小写或标点；无法定位时留空。\n比较同一对象的具体属性与条件，区分同一事实中的不同属性。优先选择足以完整表达受影响属性且有依据的旧文局部片段，保留理解所需的对象、条件和否定；不要为了缩短而破坏语义。如果只能选整个旧事实，请在 reason 解释为何无法缩小，或提出具体待确认问题；片段仍只是候选，不表示整句都应修改。\n活动必须比较实际对象和条件：模拟活动的体验不等于真实活动，也不自动推翻对真实活动的态度或风险判断；证据不能确定时提出针对差异的确认问题。使用全部给定证据，已明确的事实不要当作未知反复询问；不要把过去来源的当时状态擅自当成现在状态。理由准确概括原文，不引入新事件、关系或未证明的时间。提问只能针对材料实际留下的关键不确定性，不能包含无依据的前提。<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\n{\"memory_id\": \"b79a25de-05b7-47b7-bb0b-8c59b44a61ec\", \"memory_text\": \"Primary career motivation is improving healthcare access for underserved communities\", \"fact\": {\"fact_index\": 1, \"source_memory_id\": \"b79a25de-05b7-47b7-bb0b-8c59b44a61ec\", \"raw_subfact\": \"Primary career motivation is improving healthcare access for underserved communities.\", \"contextualized_subfact\": \"用户的主要职业动机是改善弱势社区的医疗可及性。\", \"evidence\": [{\"source_type\": \"memory\", \"source_id\": \"b79a25de-05b7-47b7-bb0b-8c59b44a61ec\", \"quote\": \"Primary career motivation is improving healthcare access for underserved communities\", \"supports\": \"旧记忆记载主要职业动机是改善弱势社区的医疗可及性；此引文本身未明确主体。\"}, {\"source_type\": \"context\", \"source_id\": \"ctx-1\", \"quote\": \"I want to ensure that my work supports my aspiration to improve healthcare access for underserved communities.\", \"supports\": \"来源中说话者（user）以第一人称陈述该愿望，用于将旧记忆中的动机主体补足为“用户”。\"}], \"pending_confirmations\": []}, \"source_context\": [{\"source_id\": \"ctx-1\", \"source_ref\": \"HaluMem/data/HaluMem-Medium.jsonl uuid=2f1f897e-d67f-dbc5-6a7b-b7634a9e294f /sessions/3/dialogue/2/content\", \"text\": \"Absolutely, I'm looking for a position that better aligns with my life goals and promotes personal well-being. I want to ensure that my work supports my aspiration to improve healthcare access for underserved communities.\", \"speaker\": \"user\", \"recorded_at\": \"Dec 15, 2025, 06:28:15\"}, {\"source_id\": \"ctx-2\", \"source_ref\": \"HaluMem/data/HaluMem-Medium.jsonl uuid=2f1f897e-d67f-dbc5-6a7b-b7634a9e294f /sessions/3/dialogue/24/content\", \"text\": \"Yes, discussing work-life balance during interviews is important to me. I want to ensure the role supports my health and goals.\", \"speaker\": \"user\", \"recorded_at\": \"Dec 15, 2025, 07:27:31\"}], \"new_evidence\": [{\"source_id\": \"dialogue-4\", \"source_ref\": \"2f1f897e-d67f-dbc5-6a7b-b7634a9e294f:s005:m004 /sessions/5/dialogue/4/content\", \"text\": \"I've been considering roles in non-profit organizations focused on healthcare access. They align with my desire to improve healthcare for underserved communities.\", \"speaker\": \"user\", \"recorded_at\": \"Jan 10, 2026, 07:28:06\"}, {\"source_id\": \"dialogue-6\", \"source_ref\": \"2f1f897e-d67f-dbc5-6a7b-b7634a9e294f:s005:m004 /sessions/5/dialogue/6/content\", \"text\": \"I think a job that offers flexibility would help me manage both my professional responsibilities and personal well-being. Pets can definitely provide emotional support, which is valuable.\", \"speaker\": \"user\", \"recorded_at\": \"Jan 10, 2026, 07:30:21\"}, {\"source_id\": \"dialogue-12\", \"source_ref\": \"2f1f897e-d67f-dbc5-6a7b-b7634a9e294f:s005:m004 /sessions/5/dialogue/12/content\", \"text\": \"I'm planning to network with professionals in the non-profit sector and explore opportunities that align with my goals. It's a step towards finding the right fit.\", \"speaker\": \"user\", \"recorded_at\": \"Jan 10, 2026, 07:43:11\"}], \"time_info\": null}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n<think>\n\n</think>\n\n","generated":""}
