er': 'user') supports that this is the user's self-report.\"}], \"pending_confirmations\": []}, \"source_context\": [{\"source_id\": \"ctx-1\", \"source_ref\": \"system/mem0_halumem_diagnosis/results/medium_dev/williams_native_prefix5_20261028_v3/users/2f1f897e-d67f-dbc5-6a7b-b7634a9e294f/session_002/input.json#/raw_dialogue/6/content [characters 0:590, zero-based, end exclusive]\", \"text\": \"Of course. I have several important friends and colleagues: ThomasSusan is my Friend, Susan's support and encouragement inspire me to maintain my focus on promoting well-being in both my personal and professional life. MartinezDaniel is my Colleague, Daniel's expertise in healthcare consulting challenges me to push boundaries and innovate in our projects, significantly impacting my career growth. WilliamsJoshua is my Colleague, Joshua's collaborative approach and insights into healthcare management enhance our team's effectiveness, positively influencing my work and leadership style.\", \"speaker\": \"user\", \"recorded_at\": \"Sep 06, 2025, 01:02:20\"}], \"new_evidence\": [{\"source_id\": \"dialogue-0\", \"source_ref\": \"2f1f897e-d67f-dbc5-6a7b-b7634a9e294f:s006:m001 /sessions/6/dialogue/0/content\", \"text\": \"I've been thinking a lot about my career lately, and I've realized that my current role isn't supporting my well-being as much as I'd like. It's crucial for me to find a new job that offers a better work-life balance and aligns with my humanitarian goals.\", \"speaker\": \"user\", \"recorded_at\": \"Feb 05, 2026, 17:13:15\"}, {\"source_id\": \"dialogue-2\", \"source_ref\": \"2f1f897e-d67f-dbc5-6a7b-b7634a9e294f:s006:m001 /sessions/6/dialogue/2/content\", \"text\": \"Susan's support has indeed been invaluable. Her encouragement helps me stay focused on my goals. And Daniel's insights have really pushed me to think outside the box in my career. It's been exciting to see how these connections have opened up new possibilities.\", \"speaker\": \"user\", \"recorded_at\": \"Feb 05, 2026, 17:15:18\"}, {\"source_id\": \"dialogue-12\", \"source_ref\": \"2f1f897e-d67f-dbc5-6a7b-b7634a9e294f:s006:m001 /sessions/6/dialogue/12/content\", \"text\": \"I'm grateful for the support I've received. It's made a huge difference in my ability to navigate this transition and stay true to my values.\", \"speaker\": \"user\", \"recorded_at\": \"Feb 05, 2026, 17:46:26\"}], \"time_info\": null}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n<think>\n\n</think>\n\n","generated":""}
