未知可空）；candidate_impact_fragment 必须是旧记忆原文的连续片段，不明确则空字符串；old_quote 必须从该事实给出的 memory 引文中逐字复制；new_quote 为 {\"source_id\":...,\"quote\":...}，quote 必须非空且逐字来自该来源；reason 为简短字符串；confirmation_questions 为字符串数组，uncertain 必须至少一问。只依据提供的材料，不把记录时间当事件时间，不推断条件或身份确定。\n补充约束：candidate_impact_fragment 只能从旧事实的 memory 引文中原样复制连续片段；new_quote 只能复制新证据来源中的原文。二者不得互换，即使新证据更适合描述变化也不能把它填入旧片段。不要改大小写或标点；无法定位时留空。\n比较同一对象的具体属性与条件，区分同一事实中的不同属性。优先选择足以完整表达受影响属性且有依据的旧文局部片段，保留理解所需的对象、条件和否定；不要为了缩短而破坏语义。如果只能选整个旧事实，请在 reason 解释为何无法缩小，或提出具体待确认问题；片段仍只是候选，不表示整句都应修改。\n活动必须比较实际对象和条件：模拟活动的体验不等于真实活动，也不自动推翻对真实活动的态度或风险判断；证据不能确定时提出针对差异的确认问题。使用全部给定证据，已明确的事实不要当作未知反复询问；不要把过去来源的当时状态擅自当成现在状态。理由准确概括原文，不引入新事件、关系或未证明的时间。提问只能针对材料实际留下的关键不确定性，不能包含无依据的前提。\n旧引文来源核对：old_quote 只能逐字复制当前 fact.evidence 中 source_type 为 \"memory\" 且 source_id 等于 memory_id 的 quote 的非空连续原文，并且该引文属于 memory_text。先检查 source_type，再复制；不能从 source_type 为 \"context\" 的 quote、source_context 或 contextualized_subfact 复制 old_quote，即使上下文与旧记忆含义相同也不行。不得改写人称、大小写或标点，不得拼接不同来源。旧上下文可用于理解主体与条件，但不能当作旧记忆原文引用。\n如果旧记忆不能支持某项所需表述，要在理由或待确认问题中如实说明，不能借用旧上下文伪造旧记忆支持；若没有合法的旧记忆引文，不能编造或替换引文，应保留无法通过校验的结果。<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\n{\"memory_id\": \"0da9428c-2fe6-4254-b818-58991562b49d\", \"memory_text\": \"Has a colleague named MartinezDaniel (referred to as 'Daniel') with expertise in healthcare consulting\", \"fact\": {\"fact_index\": 1, \"source_memory_id\": \"0da9428c-2fe6-4254-b818-58991562b49d\", \"raw_subfact\": \"Has a colleague named MartinezDaniel (referred to as 'Daniel') with expertise in healthcare consulting.\", \"contextualized_subfact\": \"用户有一位名叫 MartinezDaniel（被称为 'Daniel'）的同事，该同事在医疗咨询领域具有专业知识。\", \"evidence\": [{\"source_type\": \"memory\", \"source_id\": \"0da9428c-2fe6-4254-b818-58991562b49d\", \"quote\": \"Has a colleague named MartinezDaniel (referred to as 'Daniel') with expertise in healthcare consulting\", \"supports\": \"旧记忆记载存在一位名为 MartinezDaniel 且被称为 'Daniel' 的同事，其具备医疗咨询专业知识；此引文本身未明确拥有该同事的主体。\"}, {\"source_type\": \"context\", \"source_id\": \"ctx-1\", \"quote\": \"MartinezDaniel is my Colleague, Daniel's expertise in healthcare consulting challenges me to push boundaries and innovate in our projects\", \"supports\": \"来源上下文由标记为 'user' 的说话者陈述，确认了 MartinezDaniel 是其同事且具备医疗咨询专业知识，用于补足旧记忆中省略的主体。\"}], \"pending_confirmations\": []}, \"source_context\": [{\"source_id\": \"ctx-1\", \"source_ref\": \"HaluMem/data/HaluMem-Medium.jsonl uuid=2f1f897e-d67f-dbc5-6a7b-b7634a9e294f /sessions/1/dialogue/6/content\", \"text\": \"Of course. I have several important friends and colleagues: ThomasSusan is my Friend, Susan's support and encouragement inspire me to maintain my focus on promoting well-being in both my personal and professional life. MartinezDaniel is my Colleague, Daniel's expertise in healthcare consulting challenges me to push boundaries and innovate in our projects, significantly impacting my career growth. WilliamsJoshua is my Colleague, Joshua's collaborative approach and insights into healthcare management enhance our team's effectiveness, positively influencing my work and leadership style.\", \"speaker\": \"user\", \"recorded_at\": \"Sep 06, 2025, 01:02:20\"}], \"new_evidence\": [{\"source_id\": \"dialogue-0\", \"source_ref\": \"2f1f897e-d67f-dbc5-6a7b-b7634a9e294f:s006:m002 /sessions/6/dialogue/0/content\", \"text\": \"I've been thinking a lot about my career lately, and I've realized that my current role isn't supporting my well-being as much as I'd like. It's crucial for me to find a new job that offers a better work-life balance and aligns with my humanitarian goals.\", \"speaker\": \"user\", \"recorded_at\": \"Feb 05, 2026, 17:13:15\"}, {\"source_id\": \"dialogue-2\", \"source_ref\": \"2f1f897e-d67f-dbc5-6a7b-b7634a9e294f:s006:m002 /sessions/6/dialogue/2/content\", \"text\": \"Susan's support has indeed been invaluable. Her encouragement helps me stay focused on my goals. And Daniel's insights have really pushed me to think outside the box in my career. It's been exciting to see how these connections have opened up new possibilities.\", \"speaker\": \"user\", \"recorded_at\": \"Feb 05, 2026, 17:15:18\"}], \"time_info\": null}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n<think>\n\n</think>\n\n","generated":""}
