（未知可空）；candidate_impact_fragment 必须是旧记忆原文的连续片段，不明确则空字符串；old_quote 必须从该事实给出的 memory 引文中逐字复制；new_quote 为 {\"source_id\":...,\"quote\":...}，quote 必须非空且逐字来自该来源；reason 为简短字符串；confirmation_questions 为字符串数组，uncertain 必须至少一问。只依据提供的材料，不把记录时间当事件时间，不推断条件或身份确定。\n补充约束：candidate_impact_fragment 只能从旧事实的 memory 引文中原样复制连续片段；new_quote 只能复制新证据来源中的原文。二者不得互换，即使新证据更适合描述变化也不能把它填入旧片段。不要改大小写或标点；无法定位时留空。\n比较同一对象的具体属性与条件，区分同一事实中的不同属性。优先选择足以完整表达受影响属性且有依据的旧文局部片段，保留理解所需的对象、条件和否定；不要为了缩短而破坏语义。如果只能选整个旧事实，请在 reason 解释为何无法缩小，或提出具体待确认问题；片段仍只是候选，不表示整句都应修改。\n活动必须比较实际对象和条件：模拟活动的体验不等于真实活动，也不自动推翻对真实活动的态度或风险判断；证据不能确定时提出针对差异的确认问题。使用全部给定证据，已明确的事实不要当作未知反复询问；不要把过去来源的当时状态擅自当成现在状态。理由准确概括原文，不引入新事件、关系或未证明的时间。提问只能针对材料实际留下的关键不确定性，不能包含无依据的前提。<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\n{\"memory_id\": \"e76eedc7-87e9-4282-b7db-68ed72b0c8ba\", \"memory_text\": \"Friends and colleagues are main support system\", \"fact\": {\"fact_index\": 1, \"source_memory_id\": \"e76eedc7-87e9-4282-b7db-68ed72b0c8ba\", \"raw_subfact\": \"Friends and colleagues are main support system\", \"contextualized_subfact\": \"用户的朋友和同事是其主要支持系统。\", \"evidence\": [{\"source_type\": \"memory\", \"source_id\": \"e76eedc7-87e9-4282-b7db-68ed72b0c8ba\", \"quote\": \"Friends and colleagues are main support system\", \"supports\": \"旧记忆记载朋友和同事是主要支持系统；此引文本身未明确主体。\"}, {\"source_type\": \"context\", \"source_id\": \"ctx-1\", \"quote\": \"I'm grateful for the support from my colleagues and friends.\", \"supports\": \"来源中用户以第一人称表达对同事和朋友支持的感激，用于将旧记忆中的支持系统主体补足为用户。\"}], \"pending_confirmations\": []}, \"source_context\": [{\"source_id\": \"ctx-1\", \"source_ref\": \"HaluMem/data/HaluMem-Medium.jsonl uuid=1b846c59-456e-9550-dffd-4d23f1eca81f /sessions/4/dialogue/6/content\", \"text\": \"I'm grateful for the support from my colleagues and friends. Their encouragement helps me stay grounded.\", \"speaker\": \"user\", \"recorded_at\": \"Feb 01, 2026, 18:57:12\"}, {\"source_id\": \"ctx-2\", \"source_ref\": \"HaluMem/data/HaluMem-Medium.jsonl uuid=1b846c59-456e-9550-dffd-4d23f1eca81f /sessions/5/dialogue/2/content\", \"text\": \"The support from my colleagues and friends has been instrumental in my journey. It's refreshing to have a positive work environment that encourages my commitment to historical accuracy in films.\", \"speaker\": \"user\", \"recorded_at\": \"Mar 15, 2026, 13:58:50\"}], \"new_evidence\": [{\"source_id\": \"dialogue-4\", \"source_ref\": \"1b846c59-456e-9550-dffd-4d23f1eca81f:s007:m006 /sessions/7/dialogue/4/content\", \"text\": \"I focus on balancing both, as each type of relationship offers different support and opportunities. My existing friends have been a great source of encouragement, and the new connections are inspiring my work.\", \"speaker\": \"user\", \"recorded_at\": \"Apr 30, 2026, 06:31:17\"}, {\"source_id\": \"dialogue-6\", \"source_ref\": \"1b846c59-456e-9550-dffd-4d23f1eca81f:s007:m006 /sessions/7/dialogue/6/content\", \"text\": \"They've been invaluable. Mary helps me unwind, and Steven's expertise in set design enhances the authenticity of my films. My new network also aids in overcoming creative blocks by providing fresh ideas.\", \"speaker\": \"user\", \"recorded_at\": \"Apr 30, 2026, 06:33:29\"}], \"time_info\": null}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n<think>\n\n</think>\n\n","generated":""}
