（未知可空）；candidate_impact_fragment 必须是旧记忆原文的连续片段，不明确则空字符串；old_quote 必须从该事实给出的 memory 引文中逐字复制；new_quote 为 {\"source_id\":...,\"quote\":...}，quote 必须非空且逐字来自该来源；reason 为简短字符串；confirmation_questions 为字符串数组，uncertain 必须至少一问。只依据提供的材料，不把记录时间当事件时间，不推断条件或身份确定。\n补充约束：candidate_impact_fragment 只能从旧事实的 memory 引文中原样复制连续片段；new_quote 只能复制新证据来源中的原文。二者不得互换，即使新证据更适合描述变化也不能把它填入旧片段。不要改大小写或标点；无法定位时留空。\n比较同一对象的具体属性与条件，区分同一事实中的不同属性。优先选择足以完整表达受影响属性且有依据的旧文局部片段，保留理解所需的对象、条件和否定；不要为了缩短而破坏语义。如果只能选整个旧事实，请在 reason 解释为何无法缩小，或提出具体待确认问题；片段仍只是候选，不表示整句都应修改。\n活动必须比较实际对象和条件：模拟活动的体验不等于真实活动，也不自动推翻对真实活动的态度或风险判断；证据不能确定时提出针对差异的确认问题。使用全部给定证据，已明确的事实不要当作未知反复询问；不要把过去来源的当时状态擅自当成现在状态。理由准确概括原文，不引入新事件、关系或未证明的时间。提问只能针对材料实际留下的关键不确定性，不能包含无依据的前提。<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\n{\"memory_id\": \"d1e2e0e6-45fd-49ef-bbec-e6521db283e6\", \"memory_text\": \"Likes classical symphonies because of their complexity, historical significance, and authentic auditory experience\", \"fact\": {\"fact_index\": 1, \"source_memory_id\": \"d1e2e0e6-45fd-49ef-bbec-e6521db283e6\", \"raw_subfact\": \"Likes classical symphonies because of their complexity, historical significance, and authentic auditory experience.\", \"contextualized_subfact\": \"用户喜欢古典交响乐，因为其复杂性、历史意义和真实的听觉体验。\", \"evidence\": [{\"source_type\": \"memory\", \"source_id\": \"d1e2e0e6-45fd-49ef-bbec-e6521db283e6\", \"quote\": \"Likes classical symphonies because of their complexity, historical significance, and authentic auditory experience\", \"supports\": \"旧记忆记载了对古典交响乐的喜爱及其三个具体原因：复杂性、历史意义和真实的听觉体验；此引文本身未明确主语。\"}, {\"source_type\": \"context\", \"source_id\": \"ctx-1\", \"quote\": \"I like classical symphonies, because the complexity and historical significance of classical symphonies resonate with me. They provide an authentic auditory experience.\", \"supports\": \"来源中说话者（user）的第一人称陈述与旧记忆内容一致，用于将旧记忆中的省略主语补足为“用户”。\"}], \"pending_confirmations\": []}, \"source_context\": [{\"source_id\": \"ctx-1\", \"source_ref\": \"HaluMem/data/HaluMem-Medium.jsonl uuid=1b846c59-456e-9550-dffd-4d23f1eca81f /sessions/2/dialogue/10/content\", \"text\": \"I like classical symphonies, because the complexity and historical significance of classical symphonies resonate with me. They provide an authentic auditory experience. I like jazz from the 1920s, because I am captivated by the rich history and cultural significance of 1920s jazz. It transports me to a different era. I dislike auto-tuned pop music, because I find auto-tuned pop music lacks authenticity and depth, which are qualities I highly value in my musical preferences.\", \"speaker\": \"user\", \"recorded_at\": \"Sep 06, 2025, 22:39:05\"}], \"new_evidence\": [{\"source_id\": \"dialogue-0\", \"source_ref\": \"1b846c59-456e-9550-dffd-4d23f1eca81f:s010:m001 /sessions/10/dialogue/0/content\", \"text\": \"I recently attended a live orchestral performance at a renowned concert hall. The experience was breathtaking and really shifted my musical preferences.\", \"speaker\": \"user\", \"recorded_at\": \"Jul 13, 2026, 08:32:16\"}, {\"source_id\": \"dialogue-2\", \"source_ref\": \"1b846c59-456e-9550-dffd-4d23f1eca81f:s010:m001 /sessions/10/dialogue/2/content\", \"text\": \"The performance inspired me to delve into Baroque symphonies. The historical depth and complexity of the music align with my appreciation for authenticity.\", \"speaker\": \"user\", \"recorded_at\": \"Jul 13, 2026, 08:37:03\"}, {\"source_id\": \"dialogue-12\", \"source_ref\": \"1b846c59-456e-9550-dffd-4d23f1eca81f:s010:m001 /sessions/10/dialogue/12/content\", \"text\": \"I'm focused on Baroque for now, but I'm open to other influences as long as they align with my vision for historical accuracy.\", \"speaker\": \"user\", \"recorded_at\": \"Jul 13, 2026, 09:04:00\"}], \"time_info\": null}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n<think>\n\n</think>\n\n","generated":""}
