（未知可空）；candidate_impact_fragment 必须是旧记忆原文的连续片段，不明确则空字符串；old_quote 必须从该事实给出的 memory 引文中逐字复制；new_quote 为 {\"source_id\":...,\"quote\":...}，quote 必须非空且逐字来自该来源；reason 为简短字符串；confirmation_questions 为字符串数组，uncertain 必须至少一问。只依据提供的材料，不把记录时间当事件时间，不推断条件或身份确定。\n补充约束：candidate_impact_fragment 只能从旧事实的 memory 引文中原样复制连续片段；new_quote 只能复制新证据来源中的原文。二者不得互换，即使新证据更适合描述变化也不能把它填入旧片段。不要改大小写或标点；无法定位时留空。\n比较同一对象的具体属性与条件，区分同一事实中的不同属性。优先选择足以完整表达受影响属性且有依据的旧文局部片段，保留理解所需的对象、条件和否定；不要为了缩短而破坏语义。如果只能选整个旧事实，请在 reason 解释为何无法缩小，或提出具体待确认问题；片段仍只是候选，不表示整句都应修改。\n活动必须比较实际对象和条件：模拟活动的体验不等于真实活动，也不自动推翻对真实活动的态度或风险判断；证据不能确定时提出针对差异的确认问题。使用全部给定证据，已明确的事实不要当作未知反复询问；不要把过去来源的当时状态擅自当成现在状态。理由准确概括原文，不引入新事件、关系或未证明的时间。提问只能针对材料实际留下的关键不确定性，不能包含无依据的前提。<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\n{\"memory_id\": \"46374680-0009-4625-a3a7-f2b4e329a7b5\", \"memory_text\": \"Monthly income is 17000 USD\", \"fact\": {\"fact_index\": 1, \"source_memory_id\": \"46374680-0009-4625-a3a7-f2b4e329a7b5\", \"raw_subfact\": \"Monthly income is 17000 USD\", \"contextualized_subfact\": \"用户的月收入为 17000 美元。\", \"evidence\": [{\"source_type\": \"memory\", \"source_id\": \"46374680-0009-4625-a3a7-f2b4e329a7b5\", \"quote\": \"Monthly income is 17000 USD\", \"supports\": \"旧记忆记载月收入为 17000 美元；此引文本身未明确主体。\"}, {\"source_type\": \"context\", \"source_id\": \"ctx-1\", \"quote\": \"My monthly income is 17000 USD\", \"supports\": \"来源上下文中的第一人称陈述结合 speaker 为 user 的标记，用于将旧记忆中的收入主体补足为用户。\"}], \"pending_confirmations\": []}, \"source_context\": [{\"source_id\": \"ctx-1\", \"source_ref\": \"HaluMem/data/HaluMem-Medium.jsonl uuid=348492a7-cfe4-ee1d-73c3-c276d6ba8277 /sessions/1/dialogue/2/content\", \"text\": \"I am currently Employed, working in the technology industry. I work at Blockchain Tech as a senior developer. My monthly income is 17000 USD, and I currently have 16800 USD in savings. I work as a senior developer at Blockchain Tech, where I earn a substantial income. My role involves innovating new solutions and ensuring our technology remains cutting-edge. Despite my high earnings, I have limited savings because I frequently contribute financially to political campaigns and causes that support the politician I believe in. My career allows me to network with influential individuals who share my views.\", \"speaker\": \"user\", \"recorded_at\": \"Sep 05, 2025, 09:10:09\"}], \"new_evidence\": [{\"source_id\": \"dialogue-4\", \"source_ref\": \"348492a7-cfe4-ee1d-73c3-c276d6ba8277:s003:m004 /sessions/3/dialogue/4/content\", \"text\": \"One challenge is the lack of immediate income. I'm moving from a comfortable salary to zero income initially, which is a bit daunting.\", \"speaker\": \"user\", \"recorded_at\": \"Nov 10, 2025, 18:15:17\"}, {\"source_id\": \"dialogue-6\", \"source_ref\": \"348492a7-cfe4-ee1d-73c3-c276d6ba8277:s003:m004 /sessions/3/dialogue/6/content\", \"text\": \"I plan to rely on my savings and cut down on unnecessary expenses. I believe my contributions to political campaigns are investments towards my relative's success.\", \"speaker\": \"user\", \"recorded_at\": \"Nov 10, 2025, 18:17:51\"}], \"time_info\": null}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n<think>\n\n</think>\n\n","generated":""}
