（未知可空）；candidate_impact_fragment 必须是旧记忆原文的连续片段，不明确则空字符串；old_quote 必须从该事实给出的 memory 引文中逐字复制；new_quote 为 {\"source_id\":...,\"quote\":...}，quote 必须非空且逐字来自该来源；reason 为简短字符串；confirmation_questions 为字符串数组，uncertain 必须至少一问。只依据提供的材料，不把记录时间当事件时间，不推断条件或身份确定。\n补充约束：candidate_impact_fragment 只能从旧事实的 memory 引文中原样复制连续片段；new_quote 只能复制新证据来源中的原文。二者不得互换，即使新证据更适合描述变化也不能把它填入旧片段。不要改大小写或标点；无法定位时留空。\n比较同一对象的具体属性与条件，区分同一事实中的不同属性。优先选择足以完整表达受影响属性且有依据的旧文局部片段，保留理解所需的对象、条件和否定；不要为了缩短而破坏语义。如果只能选整个旧事实，请在 reason 解释为何无法缩小，或提出具体待确认问题；片段仍只是候选，不表示整句都应修改。\n活动必须比较实际对象和条件：模拟活动的体验不等于真实活动，也不自动推翻对真实活动的态度或风险判断；证据不能确定时提出针对差异的确认问题。使用全部给定证据，已明确的事实不要当作未知反复询问；不要把过去来源的当时状态擅自当成现在状态。理由准确概括原文，不引入新事件、关系或未证明的时间。提问只能针对材料实际留下的关键不确定性，不能包含无依据的前提。<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\n{\"memory_id\": \"e5ec2bdf-d263-4e0f-a4bd-e649154c5993\", \"memory_text\": \"Mental health is stable and normal with no mental health issues\", \"fact\": {\"fact_index\": 1, \"source_memory_id\": \"e5ec2bdf-d263-4e0f-a4bd-e649154c5993\", \"raw_subfact\": \"Mental health is stable and normal with no mental health issues.\", \"contextualized_subfact\": \"用户的心理健康状况稳定且正常，没有心理健康问题。\", \"evidence\": [{\"source_type\": \"memory\", \"source_id\": \"e5ec2bdf-d263-4e0f-a4bd-e649154c5993\", \"quote\": \"Mental health is stable and normal with no mental health issues\", \"supports\": \"旧记忆记载心理健康状况稳定、正常且无问题；此引文本身未明确主体。\"}, {\"source_type\": \"context\", \"source_id\": \"ctx-1\", \"quote\": \"In terms of mental health, I am Stable and Normal. No mental health issues.\", \"supports\": \"来源中说话者（user）以第一人称陈述相同内容，用于将旧记忆中的无主语句补足为“用户”的陈述。\"}], \"pending_confirmations\": []}, \"source_context\": [{\"source_id\": \"ctx-1\", \"source_ref\": \"HaluMem/data/HaluMem-Medium.jsonl uuid=348492a7-cfe4-ee1d-73c3-c276d6ba8277 /sessions/1/dialogue/4/content\", \"text\": \"My physical condition is Normal. No chronic diseases. In terms of mental health, I am Stable and Normal. No mental health issues. I maintain a stable physical and mental health by staying active and engaged with my work and political activities. Supporting the politician gives me a sense of purpose and fulfillment, contributing positively to my mental well-being.\", \"speaker\": \"user\", \"recorded_at\": \"Sep 05, 2025, 09:27:52\"}], \"new_evidence\": [{\"source_id\": \"dialogue-0\", \"source_ref\": \"348492a7-cfe4-ee1d-73c3-c276d6ba8277:s004:m000 /sessions/4/dialogue/0/content\", \"text\": \"I've been feeling quite stressed lately with this career transition into political consulting. Leaving my stable tech job has been more challenging than I anticipated.\", \"speaker\": \"user\", \"recorded_at\": \"Nov 25, 2025, 14:15:47\"}, {\"source_id\": \"dialogue-2\", \"source_ref\": \"348492a7-cfe4-ee1d-73c3-c276d6ba8277:s004:m000 /sessions/4/dialogue/2/content\", \"text\": \"The uncertainty of income is definitely a big concern. I used to feel secure and financially stable, but now everything seems unpredictable.\", \"speaker\": \"user\", \"recorded_at\": \"Nov 25, 2025, 14:22:20\"}, {\"source_id\": \"dialogue-10\", \"source_ref\": \"348492a7-cfe4-ee1d-73c3-c276d6ba8277:s004:m000 /sessions/4/dialogue/10/content\", \"text\": \"I really need to find a way to manage this stress better. It's affecting my mental health, and I can't afford that right now.\", \"speaker\": \"user\", \"recorded_at\": \"Nov 25, 2025, 14:46:47\"}], \"time_info\": null}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n<think>\n\n</think>\n\n","generated":""}
