（未知可空）；candidate_impact_fragment 必须是旧记忆原文的连续片段，不明确则空字符串；old_quote 必须从该事实给出的 memory 引文中逐字复制；new_quote 为 {\"source_id\":...,\"quote\":...}，quote 必须非空且逐字来自该来源；reason 为简短字符串；confirmation_questions 为字符串数组，uncertain 必须至少一问。只依据提供的材料，不把记录时间当事件时间，不推断条件或身份确定。\n补充约束：candidate_impact_fragment 只能从旧事实的 memory 引文中原样复制连续片段；new_quote 只能复制新证据来源中的原文。二者不得互换，即使新证据更适合描述变化也不能把它填入旧片段。不要改大小写或标点；无法定位时留空。\n比较同一对象的具体属性与条件，区分同一事实中的不同属性。优先选择足以完整表达受影响属性且有依据的旧文局部片段，保留理解所需的对象、条件和否定；不要为了缩短而破坏语义。如果只能选整个旧事实，请在 reason 解释为何无法缩小，或提出具体待确认问题；片段仍只是候选，不表示整句都应修改。\n活动必须比较实际对象和条件：模拟活动的体验不等于真实活动，也不自动推翻对真实活动的态度或风险判断；证据不能确定时提出针对差异的确认问题。使用全部给定证据，已明确的事实不要当作未知反复询问；不要把过去来源的当时状态擅自当成现在状态。理由准确概括原文，不引入新事件、关系或未证明的时间。提问只能针对材料实际留下的关键不确定性，不能包含无依据的前提。<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\n{\"memory_id\": \"37756be3-aaee-4e1c-b8f7-a5fed3d94890\", \"memory_text\": \"MooreSandra is a friend who shares political views and supports the same politician\", \"fact\": {\"fact_index\": 1, \"source_memory_id\": \"37756be3-aaee-4e1c-b8f7-a5fed3d94890\", \"raw_subfact\": \"MooreSandra is a friend who shares political views and supports the same politician.\", \"contextualized_subfact\": \"MooreSandra is a friend of the user who shares the user's political views and supports the same politician as the user.\", \"evidence\": [{\"source_type\": \"memory\", \"source_id\": \"37756be3-aaee-4e1c-b8f7-a5fed3d94890\", \"quote\": \"MooreSandra is a friend who shares political views and supports the same politician\", \"supports\": \"旧记忆记载 MooreSandra 是朋友，且分享政治观点并支持同一位政治家；原文未明确‘朋友’的归属对象及‘同一位’的参照对象。\"}, {\"source_type\": \"context\", \"source_id\": \"ctx-1\", \"quote\": \"MooreSandra is my Friend, Sandra shares my political views and supports the same politician\", \"supports\": \"来源上下文由 user 发言，明确 MooreSandra 是‘我的’朋友，且分享‘我的’政治观点并支持‘同一位’政治家，用于补足 raw_subfact 中的归属和参照对象。\"}], \"pending_confirmations\": []}, \"source_context\": [{\"source_id\": \"ctx-1\", \"source_ref\": \"HaluMem/data/HaluMem-Medium.jsonl uuid=348492a7-cfe4-ee1d-73c3-c276d6ba8277 /sessions/1/dialogue/6/content\", \"text\": \"Of course. I have several important friends and colleagues: MooreSandra is my Friend, Sandra shares my political views and supports the same politician, providing me with a sense of camaraderie and encouragement in my beliefs. GonzalezMary is my Friend, Mary is a close friend who often discusses political strategies with me, strengthening my resolve and commitment to support the politician. BrownMichelle is my Colleague, Michelle and I work together at Blockchain Tech, and she influences my career by helping me balance my professional responsibilities with my political interests.\", \"speaker\": \"user\", \"recorded_at\": \"Sep 05, 2025, 10:05:40\"}, {\"source_id\": \"ctx-2\", \"source_ref\": \"HaluMem/data/HaluMem-Medium.jsonl uuid=348492a7-cfe4-ee1d-73c3-c276d6ba8277 /sessions/5/dialogue/10/content\", \"text\": \"MooreSandra and GonzalezMary have been incredibly supportive, providing encouragement and strategic advice throughout this transition.\", \"speaker\": \"user\", \"recorded_at\": \"Dec 10, 2025, 18:27:24\"}], \"new_evidence\": [{\"source_id\": \"dialogue-0\", \"source_ref\": \"348492a7-cfe4-ee1d-73c3-c276d6ba8277:s006:m001 /sessions/6/dialogue/0/content\", \"text\": \"I'm really excited about finally launching my political consulting firm. It's been a long journey, but it's fulfilling to see it come to fruition. I'm planning to leverage my network, including Sandra and Mary, to secure initial clients.\", \"speaker\": \"user\", \"recorded_at\": \"Dec 20, 2025, 07:13:08\"}], \"time_info\": null}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n<think>\n\n</think>\n\n","generated":""}
