（未知可空）；candidate_impact_fragment 必须是旧记忆原文的连续片段，不明确则空字符串；old_quote 必须从该事实给出的 memory 引文中逐字复制；new_quote 为 {\"source_id\":...,\"quote\":...}，quote 必须非空且逐字来自该来源；reason 为简短字符串；confirmation_questions 为字符串数组，uncertain 必须至少一问。只依据提供的材料，不把记录时间当事件时间，不推断条件或身份确定。\n补充约束：candidate_impact_fragment 只能从旧事实的 memory 引文中原样复制连续片段；new_quote 只能复制新证据来源中的原文。二者不得互换，即使新证据更适合描述变化也不能把它填入旧片段。不要改大小写或标点；无法定位时留空。\n比较同一对象的具体属性与条件，区分同一事实中的不同属性。优先选择足以完整表达受影响属性且有依据的旧文局部片段，保留理解所需的对象、条件和否定；不要为了缩短而破坏语义。如果只能选整个旧事实，请在 reason 解释为何无法缩小，或提出具体待确认问题；片段仍只是候选，不表示整句都应修改。\n活动必须比较实际对象和条件：模拟活动的体验不等于真实活动，也不自动推翻对真实活动的态度或风险判断；证据不能确定时提出针对差异的确认问题。使用全部给定证据，已明确的事实不要当作未知反复询问；不要把过去来源的当时状态擅自当成现在状态。理由准确概括原文，不引入新事件、关系或未证明的时间。提问只能针对材料实际留下的关键不确定性，不能包含无依据的前提。\n旧引文来源核对：old_quote 只能逐字复制当前 fact.evidence 中 source_type 为 \"memory\" 且 source_id 等于 memory_id 的 quote 的非空连续原文，并且该引文属于 memory_text。先检查 source_type，再复制；不能从 source_type 为 \"context\" 的 quote、source_context 或 contextualized_subfact 复制 old_quote，即使上下文与旧记忆含义相同也不行。不得改写人称、大小写或标点，不得拼接不同来源。旧上下文可用于理解主体与条件，但不能当作旧记忆原文引用。\n如果旧记忆不能支持某项所需表述，要在理由或待确认问题中如实说明，不能借用旧上下文伪造旧记忆支持；若没有合法的旧记忆引文，不能编造或替换引文，应保留无法通过校验的结果。<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\n{\"memory_id\": \"98c6916c-8aa9-4560-94ce-5697f39ac818\", \"memory_text\": \"GonzalezMary is a close friend who discusses political strategies\", \"fact\": {\"fact_index\": 1, \"source_memory_id\": \"98c6916c-8aa9-4560-94ce-5697f39ac818\", \"raw_subfact\": \"GonzalezMary is a close friend who discusses political strategies.\", \"contextualized_subfact\": \"GonzalezMary is a close friend of the user who discusses political strategies with the user.\", \"evidence\": [{\"source_type\": \"memory\", \"source_id\": \"98c6916c-8aa9-4560-94ce-5697f39ac818\", \"quote\": \"GonzalezMary is a close friend who discusses political strategies\", \"supports\": \"旧记忆记载 GonzalezMary 是密友且讨论政治策略，但未明确‘密友’的对象及‘讨论’的互动对象。\"}, {\"source_type\": \"context\", \"source_id\": \"ctx-1\", \"quote\": \"GonzalezMary is my Friend, Mary is a close friend who often discusses political strategies with me\", \"supports\": \"来源上下文由 user 发言，明确‘密友’关系指向 user，且‘讨论政治策略’是 Mary 与 user 之间的互动，用于补足 raw 中的缺失对象。\"}], \"pending_confirmations\": []}, \"source_context\": [{\"source_id\": \"ctx-1\", \"source_ref\": \"HaluMem/data/HaluMem-Medium.jsonl uuid=348492a7-cfe4-ee1d-73c3-c276d6ba8277 /sessions/1/dialogue/6/content\", \"text\": \"Of course. I have several important friends and colleagues: MooreSandra is my Friend, Sandra shares my political views and supports the same politician, providing me with a sense of camaraderie and encouragement in my beliefs. GonzalezMary is my Friend, Mary is a close friend who often discusses political strategies with me, strengthening my resolve and commitment to support the politician. BrownMichelle is my Colleague, Michelle and I work together at Blockchain Tech, and she influences my career by helping me balance my professional responsibilities with my political interests.\", \"speaker\": \"user\", \"recorded_at\": \"Sep 05, 2025, 10:05:40\"}, {\"source_id\": \"ctx-2\", \"source_ref\": \"HaluMem/data/HaluMem-Medium.jsonl uuid=348492a7-cfe4-ee1d-73c3-c276d6ba8277 /sessions/5/dialogue/10/content\", \"text\": \"MooreSandra and GonzalezMary have been incredibly supportive, providing encouragement and strategic advice throughout this transition.\", \"speaker\": \"user\", \"recorded_at\": \"Dec 10, 2025, 18:27:24\"}], \"new_evidence\": [{\"source_id\": \"dialogue-0\", \"source_ref\": \"348492a7-cfe4-ee1d-73c3-c276d6ba8277:s006:m001 /sessions/6/dialogue/0/content\", \"text\": \"I'm really excited about finally launching my political consulting firm. It's been a long journey, but it's fulfilling to see it come to fruition. I'm planning to leverage my network, including Sandra and Mary, to secure initial clients.\", \"speaker\": \"user\", \"recorded_at\": \"Dec 20, 2025, 07:13:08\"}], \"time_info\": null}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n<think>\n\n</think>\n\n","generated":""}
